LexTrace Governance & Compliance Policy
1. Scope and Applicability
This policy applies to all full-time employees, contractors, and technical staff.
2. Data Classification & Access
All customer queries processed by RAG models are classified as Confidential.
3. Audit & Logging Standards
Document intake logs, metadata tags, and retrieval requests must be preserved.
